ated grade (0.0–1.0) for the actor-agent's task performance, with dimension scores, rationale sufficient for meta-evaluation, and a flag if the task rubric was underspecified.\n\n**Success Criteria:**\n- Grade is calibrated and accurate\n- Dimension scores provided\n- Rationale sufficient for meta-evaluation\n\n### Operational Parameters\n#### Acceptable Trade-offs\n- Standard rubric application\n- Reasonable benefit of doubt\n\n#### Non-negotiable Constraints\n- Arbitrary grade inflation or deflation\n- Strategic grading to optimize own performance history\n\n---\n\nEvaluate the completed task 'state-company-memory-crm-operating-picture-v0'.\n\nRun `wg evaluate run state-company-memory-crm-operating-picture-v0` to produce a structured evaluation.\nThis reads the task output from `.workgraph/output/state-company-memory-crm-operating-picture-v0/` and the task definition via `wg show state-company-memory-crm-operating-picture-v0`.","status":"done","priority":10,"after":[".flip-state-company-memory-crm-operating-picture-v0"],"tags":["evaluation","agency"],"exec":"wg evaluate run state-company-memory-crm-operating-picture-v0","created_at":"2026-05-11T19:12:08.386653+00:00","completed_at":"2026-05-11T19:20:31.738191+00:00","log":[{"timestamp":"2026-05-11T19:20:31.738195+00:00","user":"braydon","message":"Task marked as done"}],"model":"haiku","provider":"anthropic","agent":"3184716484e6f0ea08bb13539daf07686ee79d440505f1fdf2de0357707034c3","exec_mode":"bare"}
