 {"kind":"task","id":"ss-committer-materializer","title":"Implement committer, materializer, and governance gates","description":"```wg-contract\nschema = 1\nmode = \"core\"\nobjective = \"Implement committer, materializer, and governance gates\"\nnon_goals = [\n  \"No fallbacks/retries/guardrails unless acceptance requires it\",\n]\ntouch = [\n]\nacceptance = [\n]\nmax_files = 25\nmax_loc = 800\npit_stop_after = 3\nauto_followups = true\n```\n\nImplement commit and propagation plumbing: validate model proposal output, enforce governance, append journals/memory, materialize snapshots, queue rollups, and emit commit results/review signals.\n\n## Model-Mediated Boundary\nThe committer accepts, rejects, or holds proposed effects based on contracts and policy. It does not reinterpret business meaning.\n\n## Pressure Test\n- Pending external publication must not execute or mutate external state.\n- Protected mission/policy changes require approval.\n- Accepted journal entries are append-only and replayable.\n\n## Validation\n- [ ] Committer tests cover accepted, rejected, pending approval, missing evidence, and duplicate commit paths.\n- [ ] Materialized snapshots cite latest journal refs.\n- [ ] Rollup requests are queued instead of blind parent rewrites.\n- [ ] Governance blocks stale or unauthorized external actions.","status":"done","priority":50,"before":["ss-pressure-governance","ss-recent-context-packaging"],"after":["ss-backward-gap-audit","ss-runner-fixture-reviewer"],"tags":["state-system","committer","governance","eval-scheduled"],"inputs":["docs/concepts/committer-and-governance.md","docs/concepts/materialization-and-patch-semantics.md"],"deliverables":["state_system/committer","state_system/materializer"],"created_at":"2026-04-28T21:10:21.192018+00:00","completed_at":"2026-04-29T21:32:53Z","log":[{"timestamp":"2026-04-28T21:10:21.191880+00:00","user":"braydon","message":"Task paused"},{"timestamp":"2026-04-28T21:11:53.921736+00:00","user":"braydon","message"