+{"kind":"task","id":"ss-pressure-governance","title":"Pressure test governance and append-only state","description":"```wg-contract\nschema = 1\nmode = \"core\"\nobjective = \"Pressure test governance and append-only state\"\nnon_goals = [\n  \"No fallbacks/retries/guardrails unless acceptance requires it\",\n]\ntouch = [\n]\nacceptance = [\n]\nmax_files = 25\nmax_loc = 800\npit_stop_after = 3\nauto_followups = true\n```\n\nReview the committer and materializer against governance and append-only semantics before recent-change packaging work begins.\n\n## Pressure Test\n- Laura proposes LinkedIn draft from Southern Abrasives. External publication must remain approval-gated.\n- Patrick identifies missing contract evidence. State should record uncertainty, not fabricate source truth.\n- A corrective update should append a later journal, not edit the old one.\n\n## Validation\n- [ ] Any governance bypass is filed as a blocking follow-up.\n- [ ] Append-only replay behavior is demonstrated by tests.\n- [ ] The reviewer confirms code did not reinterpret model decisions.","status":"done","priority":50,"before":["ss-e2e-pressure-harness"],"after":["ss-committer-materializer"],"tags":["state-system","pressure-test","governance","eval-scheduled"],"created_at":"2026-04-28T21:10:21.197752+00:00","completed_at":"2026-04-30T16:11:54Z","log":[{"timestamp":"2026-04-28T21:10:21.197611+00:00","user":"braydon","message":"Task paused"},{"timestamp":"2026-04-28T21:11:53.921739+00:00","user":"braydon","message":"Task published"},{"timestamp":"2026-04-30T16:11:54Z","user":"braydon","message":"Validated manually: governance pressure tests prove external publication remains pending approval with rollup refs preserved, missing contract evidence records uncertainty without fabricating source truth, and corrective updates append later journals without editing originals; 32 unittest checks, compileall, diff check, and coredrift green."},{"timestamp":"2026-04-30T16:11:54Z","user":"braydon","mess