-{"kind":"task","id":"ss-runner-fixture-reviewer","title":"Implement runner and fixture reviewer","description":"```wg-contract\nschema = 1\nmode = \"core\"\nobjective = \"Implement runner and fixture reviewer\"\nnon_goals = [\n  \"No fallbacks/retries/guardrails unless acceptance requires it\",\n]\ntouch = [\n]\nacceptance = [\n]\nmax_files = 25\nmax_loc = 800\npit_stop_after = 3\nauto_followups = true\n```\n\nImplement the Notice and Interpret test path: source event or trigger -> evidence packet -> relevant snapshots/journals/memory/persona context -> model review packet -> fixture reviewer output.\n\n## Model-Mediated Boundary\nThe runner gathers factual inputs. The fixture reviewer returns fixture outputs for tests. Do not add heuristic meaning decisions to runner code.\n\n## Pressure Test\n- Can a no-op review pass?\n- Can missing evidence produce a review signal without mutating snapshots?\n- Can one trigger produce multiple proposals?\n\n## Validation\n- [ ] Runner builds packets matching existing examples.\n- [ ] Fixture reviewer can replay all four fixture outputs.\n- [ ] Missing evidence and no-op paths are tested.\n- [ ] No business judgment appears outside reviewer fixtures.","status":"done","priority":50,"before":["ss-committer-materializer","ss-model-reviewer-boundary"],"after":["ss-file-stores","ss-source-idempotency"],"tags":["state-system","runner","reviewer","eval-scheduled"],"inputs":["docs/concepts/state-update-lifecycle.md"],"deliverables":["state_system/runner","state_system/reviewer"],"created_at":"2026-04-28T21:10:21.185815+00:00","completed_at":"2026-04-29T17:29:59.798701+00:00","log":[{"timestamp":"2026-04-28T21:10:21.185675+00:00","user":"braydon","message":"Task paused"},{"timestamp":"2026-04-28T21:11:53.921741+00:00","user":"braydon","message":"Task published"},{"timestamp":"2026-04-29T16:52:21.243941+00:00","actor":"agent-27","user":"braydon","message":"Spawned by wg spawn --executor claude --model opus"},{"timestamp":"2026-04-29T16:52